# Netlify: what the published folder holds but the site does not serve. Netlify reads _headers and
# this file and serves neither; .htaccess is Apache's and _routes.json Cloudflare Pages', and
# `npm run build:web -- --host netlify` leaves both out in the first place. (Cloudflare Pages has no
# 404 rule: build with --host cloudflare.)
/.htaccess  /404.html  404!
/_routes.json  /404.html  404!
